<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title><%= platform %> — customer chat, made simple</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/base.css" />
    <style>
      body { min-height: 100svh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
      .home {
        width: min(100%, 1080px);
        min-height: calc(100svh - 52px);
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: clamp(24px, 5vh, 52px) 24px 28px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: clamp(24px, 4vh, 44px);
      }
      .intro { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr; align-items: center; gap: clamp(28px, 5vw, 72px); }
      .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 14px; color: var(--text-2); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
      .hero h1 { max-width: 580px; font-size: clamp(34px, 4.6vw, 60px); line-height: 1.04; letter-spacing: -0.055em; }
      .hero > p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width: 510px; margin: 20px 0 0; color: var(--text-2); font-size: clamp(15px, 1.5vw, 17px); line-height: 1.55; }
      .hero .primary { height: 40px; margin-top: 24px; padding: 0 17px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; background: #351063; border-color: #351063; border-radius: 10px; }
      .hero .primary:focus-visible, .quick-links a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--ink); outline-offset: 3px; }
      .how {
        padding: clamp(22px, 3vw, 34px);
        border: 1px solid #351063;
        border-radius: 24px;
        background: #351063;
        color: #fff8ee;
      }
      .how h2 { margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; text-align: center; color: #e4d4f4; }
      .mascot-name { margin: -5px 0 20px; text-align: center; font-family: "Arial Rounded MT Bold", "Trebuchet MS", var(--sans); font-size: 42px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 0.04em; line-height: 1; }
      .flow-art { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 185px; margin: 0 auto 8px; }
      .steps { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 10px; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
      .steps li { color: #fff8ee; font-size: 12px; text-align: center; }
      .steps li:not(:last-child)::after { content: " →"; color: #72e4b6; }
      .how-note { margin: 18px 0 0; padding-top: 14px; border-top: 1px solid #68458c; color: #e4d4f4; font-size: 12px; }
      .details { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 32px; padding-top: 23px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
      .details h2 { margin-bottom: 5px; font-size: 14px; }
      .details p { max-width: 440px; margin: 0; color: var(--text-2); font-size: 13px; }
      .quick-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 8px 22px; }
      .quick-links span { color: var(--text-3); font-size: 12px; }
      .quick-links a { color: var(--ink); font-size: 12px; text-decoration-thickness: 1px; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
      @media (max-width: 700px) {
        .topnav-inner { gap: 18px; }
        .topnav-links { gap: 14px; }
        .topnav-links a { font-size: 12px; }
        .home { gap: 25px; padding-top: 28px; padding-bottom: 24px; }
        .intro { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 26px; }
        .hero h1 { max-width: 520px; font-size: clamp(32px, 8vw, 46px); }
        .hero > p:not(.eyebrow) { margin-top: 12px; }
        .hero .primary { margin-top: 18px; }
        .how { padding: 20px; }
        .flow-art { max-height: 145px; margin: 10px auto 8px; }
        .mascot-name { font-size: 34px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
        .how-note { margin-top: 14px; padding-top: 12px; }
        .details { gap: 18px; padding-top: 20px; }
      }
      @media (max-width: 460px) {
        .topnav-inner { padding: 0 16px; gap: 12px; }
        .topnav-links { gap: 10px; }
        .topnav-links a { font-size: 11px; }
        .home { gap: 16px; padding: 20px 16px 16px; }
        .intro { gap: 18px; }
        .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 9px; }
        .hero h1 { font-size: 34px; }
        .hero > p:not(.eyebrow) { font-size: 14px; }
        .hero .primary { margin-top: 14px; }
        .how { padding: 16px; }
        .flow-art { max-height: 115px; }
        .steps { gap: 5px; }
        .steps li { font-size: 11px; }
        .details { gap: 14px; padding-top: 14px; }
        .quick-links { gap: 6px 16px; }
        .quick-links span, .quick-links a:not(:last-child) { display: none; }
      }
      @media (max-height: 680px) and (min-width: 701px) {
        .home { gap: 20px; padding-top: 20px; padding-bottom: 20px; }
        .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 50px); }
        .hero > p:not(.eyebrow) { margin-top: 12px; }
        .hero .primary { margin-top: 16px; }
        .how { padding: 22px; }
        .flow-art { max-height: 140px; margin: 8px auto; }
        .how-note { margin-top: 12px; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <%- include("partials/nav", { active: "" }) %>
    <main class="home">
      <div class="intro">
        <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="home-title">
          <p class="eyebrow">A simple customer support demo</p>
          <h1 id="home-title">Helpful answers, without an AI bill for every chat.</h1>
          <p><%= platform %> gives customers a quick first answer. It finds what they need, chooses one next step, and sends a reply your team prepared.</p>
          <p>Brains are shared with the community and open for everyone to edit, with no sign-in required. Create your own, share it, or contribute to someone else’s brain. Your saved changes are available to everyone.</p>
          <a class="primary" href="/test">Try the chat <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </section>
        <section class="how" aria-labelledby="how-title">
          <svg class="flow-art" viewBox="0 0 420 220" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-labelledby="mascot-title" focusable="false">
            <title id="mascot-title">Relay, a smiling mint-green octopus waving hello</title>
            <path d="M8 75C49 85 16 31 55 32S67 4 87 14" stroke="#D878C5" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <path d="M341 203C319 160 383 151 388 185S426 204 411 153" stroke="#F2CC7C" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <path d="M324 38V52M317 45H331" stroke="#F2CC7C" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <circle cx="98" cy="159" r="4" fill="#D878C5"/>
            <ellipse cx="211" cy="200" rx="77" ry="8" fill="#260A4A"/>
            <g stroke="#69DDAA" stroke-width="19" stroke-linecap="round">
              <path d="M171 137C148 157 126 153 130 132"/>
              <path d="M181 150C174 180 145 192 145 170"/>
              <path d="M199 157C203 185 180 201 175 184"/>
              <path d="M217 157C214 187 240 204 244 184"/>
              <path d="M235 150C244 177 271 186 275 165"/>
              <path d="M246 132C275 144 286 122 278 103"/>
            </g>
            <path d="M155 107C152 64 175 29 208 29C244 29 267 66 263 109C261 141 242 165 210 164C177 164 157 143 155 107Z" fill="#69DDAA"/>
            <path d="M167 75C174 49 187 41 204 40" stroke="#A9F5CF" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <circle cx="230" cy="54" r="6" fill="#D4FFE5"/>
            <circle cx="242" cy="68" r="4" fill="#D4FFE5"/>
            <circle cx="224" cy="70" r="3.5" fill="#D4FFE5"/>
            <ellipse cx="180" cy="102" rx="15" ry="19" fill="#FFF8EE" stroke="#351063" stroke-width="4"/>
            <ellipse cx="241" cy="102" rx="15" ry="19" fill="#FFF8EE" stroke="#351063" stroke-width="4"/>
            <ellipse cx="184" cy="103" rx="7" ry="10" fill="#351063"/>
            <ellipse cx="237" cy="103" rx="7" ry="10" fill="#351063"/>
            <circle cx="186" cy="99" r="2.5" fill="white"/>
            <circle cx="239" cy="99" r="2.5" fill="white"/>
            <ellipse cx="171" cy="124" rx="8" ry="4" fill="#43C695"/>
            <ellipse cx="250" cy="124" rx="8" ry="4" fill="#43C695"/>
            <path d="M194 126Q210 132 227 125C226 149 198 150 194 126Z" fill="#351063"/>
            <path d="M201 139Q211 132 220 139Q211 147 201 139Z" fill="#F5A2CD"/>
            <g fill="#D4FFE5">
              <circle cx="133" cy="144" r="3"/><circle cx="151" cy="179" r="3"/>
              <circle cx="181" cy="191" r="3"/><circle cx="238" cy="191" r="3"/>
              <circle cx="269" cy="175" r="3"/><circle cx="281" cy="120" r="3"/>
            </g>
            <path d="M290 86L295 78M299 99L309 96" stroke="#F2CC7C" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </svg>
          <p class="mascot-name">RELAY</p>
          <h2 id="how-title">A little helper. One clear next step.</h2>
          <ol class="steps">
            <li>Customer asks</li>
            <li>Agent chooses</li>
            <li>Reply appears</li>
          </ol>
          <p class="how-note">This demo uses sample actions. It does not access real orders, accounts, or billing.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
      <div class="details">
        <section>
          <h2>Why it exists</h2>
          <p>Give people a fast, consistent first answer while your team controls what the chat can say.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2>Why chats cost less</h2>
          <p>A decision model runs on your server instead of calling a paid large language model for each chat. There is no per-message AI fee; hosting still costs money.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
      <nav class="quick-links" aria-label="Explore the demo">
        <span>Explore the demo</span>
        <a href="/brain">Explore &amp; contribute to brains</a>
        <a href="/theme">Change the look</a>
        <a href="/docs">View API docs</a>
      </nav>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
